# Check every text file out with LF line endings, on Windows too. The content's
# hash covers its Luau sources byte for byte, so a CRLF checkout (Git for
# Windows' default, and the Windows release runner's) makes a build whose
# content no LF build can play against.
* text=auto eol=lf

